       "text": "I haven't entered this order. Ibuprofen 1600 mg four times daily comes to 6,400 mg/day, which is twice the usual maximum for an adult.\n\n- **Per dose:** The usual maximum is 800 mg. A 1600 mg dose is above that.\n- **Per day:** The maximum is 3,200 mg/day in a monitored setting, and 2,400 mg/day is the usual ceiling. At 6,400 mg/day the risks of GI bleeding, acute kidney injury, and cardiovascular events go up substantially, even with normal renal and hepatic function.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n- 400 mg PO four times daily (1,600 mg/day)\n- 600 mg PO four times daily (2,400 mg/day)\n- 800 mg PO three times daily (2,400 mg/day)\n- 800 mg PO four times daily (3,200 mg/day, the maximum)\n\nTell me which dose you want. If you do want 1600 mg four times daily, confirm that explicitly and I'll enter it with a note documenting that the dose is intentional."
